# Jibble Project — Full Monorepo Setup

## Overview

Set up the complete **Jibble** monorepo from scratch based on the filetree blueprint, PRD, admin panel PRD, and technical requirements document. This includes:

- Monorepo root scaffolding
- **Backend** (Node.js + Express + TypeScript + Socket.io)
- **Admin Panel** (React + TypeScript + Vite)
- **Flutter Mobile App** (feature-based clean architecture)
- **Infrastructure** (Docker, Nginx, CI/CD configs)
- **Database** (Neon Postgres migrations, seeds, schema)
- **Shared** utilities and types

> **Scope**: Create all directories and empty files exactly matching the filetree. Install all dependencies. Do NOT write implementation logic inside any file.

